# The Infamous Cruelclaw: a card cast "by discarding a card rather than paying its mana cost" is cast without paying its mana
# cost, so an {X} in that cost can only be 0 (CR 107.3b, 118.9). Bot1's Cruelclaw hits Bot2 (17) and its trigger exiles a Forest
# and stops at Fireball ({X}{R}: X damage divided among any number of targets, here Bot2). Bot1 casts Fireball by discarding a
# Swamp, though the three Moxen are untapped: X is 0 (the spell's mana value on the stack is 1), Fireball deals no damage and Bot2
# stays at 17.

